<title>POLAND: Rafako revises down 1996 net profit.</title>
<headline>Rafako revises down 1996 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish industrial boilermaker Rafako SA said it revised down 1996 net profit by 2.8 million zlotys to 0.7 million zlotys, but said its net results for 1997 would be increased by the same amount, an effect which will first show in May's results to be released next week.</p>
<p>&quot;(The revision is) due to current events in 1997, which significantly influenced its results for 1996,&quot; the company said giving no details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
